<title>USA: Burlington Industries to issue debt.</title>
<headline>Burlington Industries to issue debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Burlington Industries Inc is expected this week to issue $150 million in 30-year debt, dealers said on Monday.</p>
<p>The Baa3/BBB-minus rated issue is expected to be puttable in the 10th year, dealers said.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley Dean Witter is expected to underwrite the offering.</p>
<p>Burlington Industries is a major producer of textiles for apparel interior furnishings.</p>
<p>(( --  Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
